---
paths:
  - "**/*.test.tsx"
  - "**/*.test.ts"
---

# Test file conventions

Applies regardless of which directory the test file lives in - test files in
this codebase sit next to the code they test (Button.test.tsx beside
Button.tsx), so a subdirectory CLAUDE.md can't target them all: it would need
to be duplicated into every directory containing a component. A glob-pattern
rule matches by file type, not location.

- Use `describe`/`it`, not `test()`.
- Mock at the network boundary (MSW), never mock the module under test.
